<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Explorers Index rises sharply in latest week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Explorers Index rises sharply in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Perth stockbroker Eyres Reed Ltd said its Australian Explorers Index rose 52.5 points or 1.47 percent in the week to Friday. The All Ordinaries index rose by the same amount. Changes, in percent:</p>
<p>	    Feb  14 Feb 7    pct   1 Month  pct    1 Year  pct</p>
<p>Explorers 3622.6  3570.1 (+1.47) 3375.1 (+7.33)  2718.3(+33.27) ASX Gold  1761.9  1711.7 (+2.94) 1722.1 (+2.31)  2155.5(-18.26) All Ords  2482.6  2446.7 (+1.47) 2419.2 (+2.62)  2300.6 (+7.91) Oil &amp; Gas 1597.8  1638.0 (-2.45) 1593.5 (+0.27)  1143.2 (+39.76)</p>
<p>NOTE: The explorers index (base 500, March 1992) tracks the performance of 88 small capitalisation exploration companies.</p>
</text>
